---
# The repository's checks, minus two that fight the Direct3D 12 and DXGI C interfaces:
#   bugprone-invalid-enum-default-initialization  their structs are meant to be zero-initialized
#                                                 (Desc{}), and many of their enums have no zero value
#   bugprone-signed-bitwise                       their flag constants are signed (enums and macros)
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-invalid-enum-default-initialization,
  -bugprone-signed-bitwise
...
